OL,3,GNEWSAMinnie Merriman: Mum thanks public
OL,4,Afor 'incredible' support
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a nine-year-old girl who
OL,7,Fdied after being found seriously
OL,8,Finjured in Arbroath has thanked people
OL,9,Fin the town for their "incredible
OL,10,Fsupport."
OL,12,FMinnie Merriman, from Wakefield, West
OL,13,FYorkshire, died in hospital in Dundee
OL,14,Ffollowing an incident at Elliot
OL,15,FIndustrial Estate on 3 August.
OL,17,FMinnie's father Christopher Rice is
OL,18,Faccused of murdering his daughter and
OL,19,Fis currently remanded in custody ahead
OL,20,Fof a trial.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
