OL,3,GNEWSAMinnie Merriman: Mum thanks public
OL,4,Afor 'incredible' support
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a Facebook post, Laurie Merriman
OL,7,Fsaid the generosity shown by local
OL,8,Fpeople had been "overwhelming" and
OL,9,Fmeant "more to us than we could ever
OL,10,Fput into words".
